{"ref":"BDB, חתן²","hw":"חתן²","html":"† II. <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">חתן</span>]</big>  <strong>vb.denom.</strong> only<br><strong>Hithp.</strong>  <strong> make oneself a daughter’s husband (</strong>NH Hithp. <em>id.</em>, Aramaic Ithpa. <em>id.</em><strong>)</strong>—Pf. 2 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">וְהִתְחַתַּנְתֶּם</span> consec. <a data-ref=\"Joshua 23:12\" href=\"/Joshua.23.12\">Jos 23:12</a>; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּתְחַתֵּן</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 3:1\" href=\"/I_Kings.3.1\">1 K 3:1</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 18:1\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.18.1\">2 Ch 18:1</a>; 2 m. <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּתְחַתֵּן</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 7:3\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.7.3\">Dt 7:3</a> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 18:21\" href=\"/I_Samuel.18.21\">1 S 18:21</a>; Imv. <span dir=\"rtl\">הִתְחַתֵּן</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 18:22\" href=\"/I_Samuel.18.22\">1 S 18:22</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">הִתְחַתְּנוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 34:9\" href=\"/Genesis.34.9\">Gn 34:9</a>; Inf. <span dir=\"rtl\">הִתְחַתֵּן</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 18:23\" href=\"/I_Samuel.18.23\">1 S 18:23</a> + 3 times;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>make oneself daughter’s husband</em> (son-in-law) <em>to</em>, c. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 18:21\" href=\"/I_Samuel.18.21\">1 S 18:21</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 18:22\" href=\"/I_Samuel.18.22\">22</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 18:23\" href=\"/I_Samuel.18.23\">23</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 18:26\" href=\"/I_Samuel.18.26\">26</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 18:27\" href=\"/I_Samuel.18.27\">27</a>; c. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶת</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 3:1\" href=\"/I_Kings.3.1\">1 K 3:1</a>; c. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 18:1\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.18.1\">2 Ch 18:1</a>, of marriage of Jehoshaphat’s son and Ahab’s daughter (cf. <a data-ref=\"II Kings 8:18\" href=\"/II_Kings.8.18\">2 K 8:18</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 21:6\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.21.6\">2 Ch 21:6</a>). <strong>2.</strong>  in gen. <em>form marriage-alliance with</em>, c. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 7:3\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.7.3\">Dt 7:3</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 23:12\" href=\"/Joshua.23.12\">Jos 23:12</a> (D), <a data-ref=\"Ezra 9:14\" href=\"/Ezra.9.14\">Ezr 9:14</a>; c. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶת</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 34:9\" href=\"/Genesis.34.9\">Gn 34:9</a> (P).","next":"BDB, חֲתֻנָּה","prev":"BDB, חָתָן"}